# Design system

One palette. Do not add a theme switcher back.

| Token | Hex | Use |
|---|---|---|
| `brand` | `#0f6b73` | CTAs, links, icon wells, header strip |
| `mist` | `#d7e6e5` | Alternate section fills |
| `sand` | `#c5b48a` | Stars, small labels, Popular badge |
| `cream` | `#e4ebe9` | Page background |
| `card` | `#f3eee4` | Solid cards (`.card`) |
| `ink` | `#1a2423` | Type, footer |

Glass (`.glass-frost`) only on the hero panel and reviews pill. All other surfaces use `.card` or `bg-brand`.

Header has a 4px `border-t-brand`. Radius `rounded-lg` / `rounded-2xl`. Type: Fraunces headings, Figtree UI.
